<h4 align="center">Can this PC realistically run Leonida (GTA VI Xbox→PC) when the port is playable? CPU, RAM, Vulkan — no build tools.</h4>

<p align="center"><i>Companion to <a href="https://github.com/ProjectLeonidaL/leonida">Leonida Legacy</a> — community continuation of Project Leonida, static recompilation of GTA VI (Xbox Series) for Windows.</i></p>

